  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/qr), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/qr/), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61428376), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000055980), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9504236), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61428376), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4419007161)\n\nIt was a day I would rather die. A life full of time, money, and nothing, his father disappeared with the money Hyuk had saved with difficulty. The only clue left in the house is Qa R code... Hyuk wanders every night in search of another QR code with the woman his father was with before disappearing.",
